 right place! Whether fruity and fresh with Pomegranate, tart and elegant like an Italian Aperitivo, or strong and pure with our High Proof - each flavour brings something totally unique to the table.<\/p>","show_description":false,"grey_sold_out_products":true,"description_style":"body","collection":"try-january-2","products_to_show":3,"columns_desktop":3,"full_width":false,"section_animation":"none","show_view_all":true,"view_all_style":"solid","view_all_button_label":"","enable_desktop_slider":true,"color_scheme":"background-1","image_ratio":"adapt","show_secondary_image":true,"show_vendor":false,"show_rating":false,"enable_quick_add":true,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":true,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"rich_text_QdDBTz":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"button_KtKCqQ":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Discover all flavours","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/moonshine","button_style_secondary":false}}},"block_order":["button_KtKCqQ"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":24}},"multicolumn_xDDg6L":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"column_6Bwfjm":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Nutty.jpg","overlay_title":false,"overlay_title_position":"bottom","title":"Go nuts for O'Donnell Moonshine!","text":"<p>Described as being 'like drinking boozy Ferraro Rocher', Tough Nut has been a firm fan favourite and best-seller among the O'Donnell range for years!<\/p><p>But, that's not the only reason to go nuts for O'Donnell Moonshine in 2025. Why not give the 'hidden gem' of the O'Donnell range, Macadamia, a shot this year. <\/p><p>With a buttery, almost creamy flavour profile finished with a subtle sweetness and hints of vanilla, this flavour is the perfect winter warmer for the cold, dark months!<\/p>","mobile_text":"","link_label":"","link":"","button_alignment":"left","selected_button":false,"grey_out_media":false}},"column_EEUMha":{"type":"column","settings":{"i